{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Would you like to brighten up your desktop with some desco?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can build blocks on your desktop, burn away your to-do list, or set a &quot;time bomb&quot; for end-of-work explosions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to purchase desco~</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We offer desco that will be continuously updated!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Please write in the comments section if you have items you'd like us to add!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Current features include:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A campfire for burning paper notes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To-do notes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A button to create new to-do notes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Timer bomb</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Alarm bomb</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Block set (freely placeable)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A bouncy ball and bouncy cube</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some settings options</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >[Will not affect desktop usage]</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Just like real clutter, you can move them aside or click through the gaps to use other desktop items.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3930720?t=1758295485","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3930720?t=1758295485","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3930720/d2a1e1401a12e808d7adb9ba78d43f2014226676/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758295485","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3930720/d2a1e1401a12e808d7adb9ba78d43f2014226676/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1758295485","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_des